    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "comp_agent_loop_desc",
      "x": 575,
      "y": 322,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 85,
      "text": "• 状态跃迁: Thought → Action (tool_calls) → Observation (tool_results) 循环推进\n• 步数兜底: step < maxSteps (默认20)，超时优雅终止并返回已完成上下文\n• 弹性容错: 工具执行异常以 { ok: false, output: err } 回灌模型，不引发进程崩溃\n• 生命周期事件: emit('thought' | 'tool_call' | 'tool_result' | 'message' | 'finish')",
      "originalText": "• 状态跃迁: Thought → Action (tool_calls) → Observation (tool_results) 循环推进\n• 步数兜底: step < maxSteps (默认20)，超时优雅终止并返回已完成上下文\n• 弹性容错: 工具执行异常以 { ok: false, output: err } 回灌模型，不引发进程崩溃\n• 生命周期事件: emit('thought' | 'tool_call' | 'tool_result' | 'message' | 'finish')",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
